  (descr "Tactile pushbutton, Akizuki DTS-63-N-V-BLK (通販コード103647). 4-pin THT, 4x dia1.0mm round PTH holes at the corners of a 6.50mm(X) x 4.50mm(Y) rectangle. Body 6.2x6.2mm, height 7mm. Internal pin-pair wiring (which 2 pins are shorted together) is not individually confirmed from the datasheet, so wire defensively: bundle both pins on one side (pad 1/2) to one net and both pins on the other side (pad 3/4) to the other net -- this is electrically correct regardless of the actual internal short pattern. Source: manufacturer datasheet (2026-08-21).")
